1
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,670
[Kim Hyeonseo as Sung Ho]

2
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,600
[Jung Myeongcheol as Yoo Sehyun]

3
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,700
[Kim Seonghyuk as Kwon Hyukjae]

4
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,670
[Jung Hyunwoong as Kim Minho]

5
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,070
[Sin and Love]

6
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:36,100
[Episode 7]

7
00:01:30,039 --> 00:01:30,640
Sehyun,

8
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:34,880
how many years
have you been working for me?

9
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:39,240
Five years.

10
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:42,950
That's right.

11
00:01:43,890 --> 00:01:44,890
It's been 5 years.

12
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:48,789
I've been feeding you
for the past 5 years.

13
00:01:50,229 --> 00:01:52,759
And how dare you
mess up my business like this?

14
00:01:54,390 --> 00:01:54,910
Hyung,

15
00:01:56,350 --> 00:01:58,009
I did everything you ordered.

16
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:03,700
Then why are the police

17
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:05,980
always investigating Gangnam Palace?

18
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:08,610
That can't be.

19
00:02:08,789 --> 00:02:09,650
It's all over.

20
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,120
Over?

21
00:02:21,210 --> 00:02:22,310
Did you know

22
00:02:22,390 --> 00:02:25,780
that Sung Ho started investigating
the drug case a few years ago?

23
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:28,380
He even investigated
Gangnam Palace himself!

24
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:33,380
Hey.

25
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:40,210
You're in cahoots with him, aren't you?

26
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:42,480
Whatever.

27
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,400
Let's end this all.

28
00:02:55,579 --> 00:02:56,440
Open your eyes.

29
00:02:57,550 --> 00:02:59,480
'Cause I don't want to kill you yet.

30
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:02,790
Sung Ho...

31
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,530
will come to save me.

32
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,120
Is that so?

33
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:09,110
Great.

34
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,170
Then I'll kill you both.

35
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:16,350
Just kill me.

36
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:23,950
I can't do that.

37
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:27,310
You can't die right now.

38
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:30,850
Because Sung Ho will come to save you.

39
00:03:33,790 --> 00:03:34,590
Kwon Hyukjae!

40
00:03:39,450 --> 00:03:39,910
Sung Ho.

41
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,480
Don't move.

42
00:03:46,910 --> 00:03:47,480
Sung Ho,

43
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:49,780
you better think carefully.

44
00:03:50,140 --> 00:03:52,000
Don't you want to save Yoo Sehyun?

45
00:04:10,110 --> 00:04:10,910
That's right.

46
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:15,740
You found this place
faster than I expected.

47
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,510
Let Sehyun go.

48
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,620
Did you come alone?

49
00:04:21,779 --> 00:04:22,250
Yes.

50
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:24,280
No backup?

51
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:25,710
I came alone.

52
00:04:29,650 --> 00:04:30,050
Hey.

53
00:04:31,250 --> 00:04:32,850
Sung Ho, you're so arrogant.

54
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:34,850
Okay.

55
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,030
You found this place by yourself—

56
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,409
that's impressive.

57
00:04:39,990 --> 00:04:42,190
But coming alone is basically suicide.

58
00:04:45,909 --> 00:04:46,370
Sung Ho,

59
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,120
do you know where this is?

60
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:54,710
A place where you can do
whatever you want, right?

61
00:04:55,950 --> 00:04:56,480
Right.

62
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,520
This is my territory.

63
00:04:59,659 --> 00:05:02,060
My territory
with no CCTV and no one around.

64
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:08,190
No one would know if someone died here.

65
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:09,340
That's right.

66
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:13,680
It means no one would know
if someone died.

67
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:18,510
You

68
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:22,300
have been investigating me
for a long time, haven't you?

69
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,630
So what did you find out?

70
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,170
Gangnam Palace's

71
00:05:26,820 --> 00:05:29,110
dirty money has been laundered
into clean money.

72
00:05:29,110 --> 00:05:30,840
You made Sehyun keep the ledger

73
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,480
so he could take the blame.

74
00:05:40,909 --> 00:05:41,170
Hey.

75
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:44,880
Do you know why you can't apprehend me?

76
00:05:45,930 --> 00:05:47,610
Because you're inhuman.

77
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:49,110
No.

78
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:52,110
It's because you're tracking me down.

79
00:05:53,050 --> 00:05:53,550
Me?

80
00:05:55,010 --> 00:05:56,409
You're tracking me down,

81
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,680
so I'm being more careful.

82
00:05:59,670 --> 00:06:01,670
No one can catch me when I'm careful.

83
00:06:03,050 --> 00:06:05,910
Ultimately, you can't escape
from my grasp either.

84
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:12,790
Hey, damn it.

85
00:06:15,710 --> 00:06:18,080
Relax, you rascal.

86
00:06:19,050 --> 00:06:19,680
Okay.

87
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:23,970
Let's not talk about work
and talk about something else.

88
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:25,280
Do you like him?

89
00:06:25,790 --> 00:06:26,810
That's why you came here?

90
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:28,110
Don't touch Sehyun.

91
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,140
Bastard.

92
00:06:35,450 --> 00:06:36,650
If you want him to live,

93
00:06:36,650 --> 00:06:37,460
then answer my questions properly.

94
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,659
What's your problem?

95
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:42,730
What exactly do you want?

96
00:06:47,409 --> 00:06:48,010
Okay.

97
00:06:50,659 --> 00:06:51,060
Kneel.

98
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:53,510
What?

99
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,260
I told you to kneel.

100
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:59,040
Then I'll consider
whether or not to kill him.

101
00:06:59,050 --> 00:06:59,850
Sung Ho.

102
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:01,780
Don't do it. Just go.

103
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:12,770
I'll count to 3.

104
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:14,480
1,

105
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:16,550
2...

106
00:07:34,090 --> 00:07:36,060
An ace cop—

107
00:07:36,110 --> 00:07:37,580
have you no pride?

108
00:07:39,550 --> 00:07:40,050
Hey.

109
00:07:42,050 --> 00:07:42,409
Hey!

110
00:07:44,150 --> 00:07:45,370
Take off your clothes.

111
00:07:45,370 --> 00:07:45,909
What?

112
00:07:46,090 --> 00:07:47,690
I said take off your clothes.

113
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:50,880
I have to see
if you have any listening devices on you.

114
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:39,610
Hey, you have a nice body.

115
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:43,610
No wonder he likes you.

116
00:08:46,770 --> 00:08:47,440
All right.

117
00:08:51,010 --> 00:08:52,070
Take off your belt.

118
00:08:57,010 --> 00:08:58,070
Didn't you hear me?

119
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:58,920
Don't do it.

120
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,850
I said take off your belt.

121
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:24,340
Okay, next.

122
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:26,840
Tie your hands.

123
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,740
I said tie your hands.

124
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:31,420
Don't.

125
00:09:32,180 --> 00:09:33,010
Don't...

126
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:36,240
Didn't you hear me?

127
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,050
Hands—

128
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:41,710
tie them up.

129
00:09:56,650 --> 00:09:58,810
Hey, damn, you're so good at this.

130
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:01,480
All right.

131
00:10:02,890 --> 00:10:04,020
Now crawl over here.

132
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,410
Crawl over like a dog.

133
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,040
Hey, Sung Ho, don't.

134
00:10:11,370 --> 00:10:12,410
I said don't do it!

135
00:10:13,650 --> 00:10:14,180
Hey.

136
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:16,150
Shut up.

137
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:30,910
Keep going.

138
00:10:36,350 --> 00:10:37,980
Okay, that's enough.

139
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:55,380
You must be thinking, why is this bastard
humiliating me so much, right?

140
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,340
Then let me tell you.

141
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,340
You can't protect anyone—

142
00:11:02,650 --> 00:11:03,850
including yourself,

143
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,650
and the people you want to protect.

144
00:11:07,650 --> 00:11:08,710
Shut up!

145
00:11:14,150 --> 00:11:14,690
Got it.

146
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:28,170
Look up.

147
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:31,570
Now tell me,

148
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:33,800
your family's secret.

149
00:11:37,410 --> 00:11:38,680
I don't know.

150
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,210
What is the relationship between

151
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:45,140
your father and Assemblyman Zhao?

152
00:11:45,540 --> 00:11:46,650
Tell me.

153
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:52,110
I left home in high school, I don't know.

154
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:53,940
Left home in high school?

155
00:11:55,950 --> 00:11:57,010
Sounds quite real.

156
00:11:58,540 --> 00:11:59,310
Then did you

157
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,680
leave home voluntarily?

158
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,250
Didn't your father pave the way

159
00:12:03,250 --> 00:12:04,510
for you to become a cop?

160
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,980
I got in on my own.

161
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:14,900
Damn it!

162
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,040
Okay.

163
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:29,940
Then walk out of here yourself.

164
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,940
Hey, Sehyun.

165
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:53,050
The guy who said he'd save you

166
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:56,020
is kneeling and crawling here. Damn it.

167
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:08,860
This is the guy you chose.

168
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,150
Got it?

169
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:11,960
Kwon Hyukjae.

170
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,550
You're inhuman.

171
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:17,520
I got to where I am today thanks to that.

172
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,230
Sung Ho.

173
00:13:44,190 --> 00:13:45,650
I'll ask you one last time.

174
00:13:46,890 --> 00:13:48,350
Are you not going to give me
the information?

175
00:13:48,350 --> 00:13:50,550
I don't know what you're talking about.

176
00:13:58,300 --> 00:13:59,700
Let's keep playing then.

177
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:03,950
Sung Ho.

178
00:14:04,850 --> 00:14:05,780
Sung Ho, save me!

179
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:46,050
Enough!

180
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:02,110
What?

181
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,420
Ready to change your mind?

182
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:06,240
Then speak.

183
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:08,250
What can you give me?

184
00:15:11,180 --> 00:15:11,980
I'll tell you.

185
00:15:15,370 --> 00:15:15,960
Okay.

186
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:28,850
Come on.

187
00:15:30,410 --> 00:15:31,080
Tell me.

188
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,010
The information...

189
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:45,020
Who's there?

190
00:15:46,650 --> 00:15:47,310
It's me,

191
00:15:47,730 --> 00:15:48,710
Kim Minho.

192
00:15:52,250 --> 00:15:53,450
O-Officer.

193
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:54,970
This isn't right.

194
00:15:55,370 --> 00:15:56,630
Sung Ho is one of us.

195
00:15:56,710 --> 00:15:58,170
This is crossing the line.

196
00:15:59,180 --> 00:15:59,650
What?

197
00:16:01,550 --> 00:16:04,150
Arresting him will solve this.

198
00:16:04,290 --> 00:16:06,020
It shouldn't be coming to this.

199
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:15,050
Hey.

200
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,880
Are you trying to teach me what to do?

201
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:18,810
That's not it.

202
00:16:19,190 --> 00:16:20,650
This is really dangerous!

203
00:16:26,530 --> 00:16:27,350
Minho.

204
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:31,670
Didn't you say
you wanted to climb to the top?

205
00:16:32,350 --> 00:16:34,210
That's why I paved the way for you!

206
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:39,210
But now you're playing the good guy,
you jerk.

207
00:16:39,450 --> 00:16:41,010
I do want to climb to the top.

208
00:16:42,010 --> 00:16:42,610
But...

209
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,480
It shouldn't be this way.

210
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:53,080
Damn it.

211
00:16:54,290 --> 00:16:55,180
All right then.

212
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:57,210
You tell me.

213
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,030
How should we resolve this now?

214
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:09,500
Hey.

215
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,099
Kiss him.

216
00:17:14,020 --> 00:17:14,550
Huh?

217
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:17,880
Don't you want to climb to the top?

218
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:20,099
You two figure it out.

219
00:17:29,530 --> 00:17:31,190
If you don't kiss him, Sung Ho,

220
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:34,280
he'll die.

221
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:47,970
[Sin and Love]
